SOAPBOX: due to family visiting. From what I could tell during the very limited
SOAPBOX: time I was able to play on 10 and 15, both bands seemed to be in good
SOAPBOX: condition. I had a break in the family action Sunday afternoon for a
SOAPBOX: short bit around 21:00UTC, and found 15m still open to EU and also
SOAPBOX: heard and worked JA during this time frame. Now I wish our middle son
SOAPBOX: would have scheduled his wedding a weekend earlier! Had fun in the
SOAPBOX: limited time I had to play. Always a fun contest to play in.
SOAPBOX: 73, Gene N9TF
